{"assertionId":"452558b3-f832-4174-84b6-f2f7be08de1d","entityBindings":[],"fragments":[{"exactText":"Each test includes a simple finger-stick blood collection that takes approximately 3 minutes. Patients follow the enclosed instructions and return their sample via USPS drop-off using the prepaid materials provided.","fragmentId":"sha256:7969ed8c9960cb2ed2bfa3b13d67b382ca55b00109e62859b56d58e93539a7e5"}],"proposition":"The described collection uses a saliva sample.","qualifiers":[],"rubricVersion":"evidence-only.v1"}